   {
    "field": "description",
    "fieldtype": "jira",
    "fieldId": "description",
    "from": null,
    "fromString": "Two design-vs-build mismatches that aren't covered by a numbered requirement, so raising as clarifications rather than defects.\n\n*1. Global header search appearance (mobile)*\nDesign shows a full-width search *field* in the mobile header; the build shows a *magnifier icon only*. The PRD covers the global search's _behaviour_ (Story 14 \u2014 navigational only, page filtering removed) but not its appearance. Is the icon-only header search intended, or should it match the design?\n\n*2. Primary CTA label \u2014 \"Create Work Order\" vs \"New Work Order\"*\nThe build reads *\"Create Work Order\"* on both desktop and mobile; the design and PRD (S13-R18) both refer to *\"New Work Order\"*. Which label is correct? If the design is right, this is an app-wide copy change; if the build is right, the design and S13-R18 should be updated.\n\n*Reference*\nPRD Filters / Confluence v19 (https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters) \u2014 S13-R18; Story 14. Design: Page search component (Figma node 11829-8908).",
    "to": null,
    "toString": "Two design-vs-build mismatches that aren't covered by a numbered requirement, so raising as clarifications rather than defects.\n\n*1. Global header search appearance (mobile)*\nDesign shows a full-width search *field* in the mobile header; the build shows a *magnifier icon only*. The PRD covers the global search's _behaviour_ (Story 14 \u2014 navigational only, page filtering removed) but not its appearance. Is the icon-only header search intended, or should it match the design?\n\n*Design:*\n\n\n!image-20260810-092626.png|width=500,alt=\"image-20260810-092626.png\"!\n\n\n*App:* \n\n\n!image-20260810-092728.png|width=583,alt=\"image-20260810-092728.png\"!\n\n\n\n*2. Primary CTA label \u2014 \"Create Work Order\" vs \"New Work Order\"*\nThe build reads *\"Create Work Order\"* on both desktop and mobile; the design and PRD (S13-R18) both refer to *\"New Work Order\"*. Which label is correct? If the design is right, this is an app-wide copy change; if the build is right, the design and S13-R18 should be updated.\n\n*Design*:\n\n\n!image-20260810-092848.png|width=864,alt=\"image-20260810-092848.png\"!\n\n\n\n*App:* \n\n!image-20260810-092936.png|width=864,alt=\"image-20260810-092936.png\"!\n\n\n\n*Reference*\nPRD Filters / Confluence v19 (https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters) \u2014 S13-R18; Story 14. Design: Page search component (Figma node 11829-8908)."
   }
  ]
 },
